  "user_id": 18602,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Debug a Game Loop\r\n\r\nYou're a Game Engineer reviewing AI-generated code for an NPC patrol system. The AI wrote the guard patrol loop, but something is wrong.\r\n\r\nThe guard is supposed to patrol a castle hallway. Each step:\r\n- the guard moves to the next patrol point\r\n- the program checks whether the player has been spotted\r\n- the patrol continues only while the player has not been spotted\r\n\r\nThe loop should stop when the guard notices the player. Then the game should show that the player was spotted.\r\n\r\n**Your job:** Run the code and use the Debugging Checklist to find what is missing. Fix the loop so the guard checks for the player each step and stops patrolling when the player is spotted.",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true",
    "predict_settings": {
      "isPredictLevel": false,
      "solution": "",
      "questionType": "freeResponse",
      "placeholderText": "",
      "multipleChoiceOptions": [
        ""
      ],
      "freeResponseHeight": 50,
      "codeEditableAfterSubmit": false
    },
    "ai_tutor_prompt_settings": {
      "answerTypes": [
        "hint",
        "example",
        "explainCode",
        "pseudocode"
      ],
      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
      }
    },
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Castle Patrol — Debug the Guard</title>\n\n  <!-- Press Start 2P: classic pixel-art / retro game font -->\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n  <!-- All styling lives in style.css -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <!-- Outer wrapper centres the game on the page -->\n  <div id=\"game-container\">\n\n    <!-- Title bar above the canvas -->\n    <div id=\"title-bar\">&#9876; CASTLE PATROL</div>\n\n    <!-- Canvas wrapper holds the game canvas + result overlay -->\n    <div id=\"canvas-wrapper\">\n\n      <!-- The main 800×400 game canvas — all drawing happens here -->\n      <canvas id=\"game-canvas\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\"></canvas>\n\n      <!-- Result overlay — hidden until the while-loop finishes -->\n      <div id=\"result-overlay\" class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n    </div><!-- end canvas-wrapper -->\n\n  </div><!-- end game-container -->\n\n  <!--\n    helpers.js is loaded here. It sets up the game engine and, on\n    window load, fetches script.js and evals it to run the student's code.\n    script.js is intentionally NOT linked as a <script> tag.\n  -->\n  <script src=\"helpers.js\"></script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0",
          "type": "support"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "contents": "*, *::before, *::after {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background-color: #0a0c10;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  color: #e0e0e0;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n#game-container {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 800px;\n}\n\n#title-bar {\n  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #0f0f1e 100%);\n  border: 2px solid #3a3a5a;\n  border-bottom: none;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px 16px;\n  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;\n  font-size: clamp(10px, 2.4vw, 14px);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: #ffa500;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.6);\n  text-align: center;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n#canvas-wrapper {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 2 / 1;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(80, 120, 180, 0.4);\n  border: 2px solid #3a3a5a;\n}\n\n#game-canvas {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n  image-rendering: crisp-edges;\n}\n\n#result-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 24px;\n  opacity: 0;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  transition: opacity 0.4s ease;\n}\n\n#result-overlay.visible {\n  opacity: 1;\n  pointer-events: all;\n}\n\n#result-overlay.hidden {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n#result-overlay.bug-present {\n  background: rgba(60, 0, 0, 0.88);\n}\n\n#result-overlay.bug-present .result-title {\n  color: #ff4444;\n  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;\n  font-size: clamp(12px, 3vw, 18px);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 50, 50, 0.8);\n  animation: flash-red 1s step-end infinite;\n}\n\n#result-overlay.bug-present .result-sub {\n  color: #ffcccc;\n  font-size: clamp(14px, 3vw, 18px);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  max-width: 560px;\n}\n\n#result-overlay.bug-fixed {\n  background: rgba(0, 30, 10, 0.88);\n}\n\n#result-overlay.bug-fixed .result-title {\n  color: #44ff88;\n  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;\n  font-size: clamp(12px, 3vw, 20px);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(50, 255, 100, 0.8);\n}\n\n#result-overlay.bug-fixed .result-sub {\n  color: #ccffdd;\n  font-size: clamp(14px, 3vw, 18px);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.play-again-btn {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  min-height: 44px;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n  font-size: clamp(14px, 3vw, 17px);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  background: #1a1a2e;\n  color: #ffa500;\n  border: 2px solid #ffa500;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n  transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s, transform 0.15s;\n}\n\n.play-again-btn:hover {\n  background: #ffa500;\n  color: #080810;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.6);\n  transform: scale(1.05);\n}\n\n.play-again-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #ffffff;\n  outline-offset: 4px;\n}\n\n@keyframes flash-red {\n  0%, 49% {\n    opacity: 1;\n  }\n\n  50%, 100% {\n    opacity: 0.4;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 500px) {\n  body {\n    padding: 8px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n\n  #title-bar {\n    font-size: 10px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    padding: 10px 8px;\n  }\n\n  #result-overlay {\n    gap: 10px;\n    padding: 16px;\n  }\n\n  #result-overlay.bug-present .result-title,\n  #result-overlay.bug-fixed .result-title {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  #result-overlay.bug-present .result-sub,\n  #result-overlay.bug-fixed .result-sub,\n  .play-again-btn {\n    font-size: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .play-again-btn {\n    padding: 10px 18px;\n  }\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false,
          "type": "support"
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "helpers.js",
          "contents": "/*\n  helpers.js — Castle Patrol Game Engine (Top-Down View, Redesigned)\n  ===================================================================\n  Students do NOT edit this file.\n\n  This file handles everything except the patrol logic:\n    - Canvas setup and scene drawing (top-down castle map with grey-blue tiles)\n    - Pixel-art sprite definitions (guard purple-grey, player brownish-red)\n    - Patrol mechanics and safety cap\n    - Event queue and animated playback\n    - Bootstrap: fetches script.js, evals it, reruns on Play Again\n\n  Sections:\n    1. Constants & canvas setup\n    2. Pre-baked tile colour grid (TILE_COLORS)\n    3. Pixel-art sprite data\n    4. Drawing helpers (sprites, background, walls, HUD)\n    5. Game state & event queue\n    6. Patrol engine (patrolStep, detectPlayer, alertMode)\n    7. Animation playback (animateEvents, drawScene)\n    8. Result overlay\n    9. Bootstrap (fetch + eval script.js)\n*/\n\n\n/* ============================================================\n   1. CONSTANTS & CANVAS SETUP\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst SCALE = 3;\nconst PATROL_WIDTH = 14;\nconst PLAYER_PATH_POS = 7;\n\nconst LEFT_BOUND = 60;\nconst PATROL_PX = 680;\n\nconst PATROL_Y_GUARD = 100;\nconst PATROL_Y_PLAYER = 250;\n\nconst CANVAS_W = 800;\nconst CANVAS_H = 400;\n\nconst HUD_Y = 360;\nconst HUD_HEIGHT = CANVAS_H - HUD_Y;\n\nconst TILE_SIZE = 48;\nconst GRID_LINE_W = 2;\n\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('game-canvas');\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n\n/* ============================================================\n   2. PRE-BAKED TILE COLOUR GRID\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst TILE_COLS = Math.ceil(CANVAS_W / TILE_SIZE) + 1;\nconst TILE_ROWS = Math.ceil(HUD_Y / TILE_SIZE) + 1;\n\nconst TILE_COLORS = [];\n\nfor (let tr = 0; tr < TILE_ROWS; tr++) {\n  TILE_COLORS.push([]);\n\n  for (let tc = 0; tc < TILE_COLS; tc++) {\n    const rBase = 0x8f;\n    const gBase = 0xa8;\n    const bBase = 0xbc;\n    const offset = (Math.random() * 16 | 0) - 8;\n    const r = Math.min(255, Math.max(0, rBase + offset));\n    const g = Math.min(255, Math.max(0, gBase + offset));\n    const b = Math.min(255, Math.max(0, bBase + offset));\n\n    TILE_COLORS[tr].push('rgb(' + r + ',' + g + ',' + b + ')');\n  }\n}\n\n\n/* ============================================================\n   3. PIXEL-ART SPRITE DATA\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst GUARD_SPRITE_BASE = [\n  ['.', '.', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '#554466', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#554466', '.', '.'],\n  ['#554466', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#9966cc', '#9966cc', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#554466', '.', '.'],\n  ['#554466', '#7755aa', '#9966cc', '#9966cc', '#9966cc', '#9966cc', '#7755aa', '#554466', '.', '.'],\n  ['#554466', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#9966cc', '#9966cc', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#554466', '.', '.'],\n  ['#554466', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#7755aa', '#554466', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '#554466', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '#3a2255', '#3a2255', '#3a2255', '#3a2255', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n];\n\nconst GUARD_SPRITE_W = 8;\nconst GUARD_SPRITE_H = 8;\n\nconst PLAYER_SPRITE = [\n  ['.', '.', '#8b3a1a', '#8b3a1a', '#8b3a1a', '#8b3a1a', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '#8b3a1a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#8b3a1a', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['#8b3a1a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#e8c098', '#e8c098', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#8b3a1a', '.', '.'],\n  ['#8b3a1a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#e8c098', '#e8c098', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#8b3a1a', '.', '.'],\n  ['#8b3a1a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#8b3a1a', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '#8b3a1a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#c45a2a', '#8b3a1a', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '#8b3a1a', '#8b3a1a', '#8b3a1a', '#8b3a1a', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '.', '#6b2a10', '#6b2a10', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n];\n\nconst ALERT_SPRITE = [\n  ['.', '#ffee00', '#ffee00', '#ffee00', '.'],\n  ['#ffee00', '#ff2222', '#ff2222', '#ffee00', '.'],\n  ['#ffee00', '#ff2222', '#ff2222', '#ffee00', '.'],\n  ['#ffee00', '#ff2222', '#ff2222', '#ffee00', '.'],\n  ['.', '#ffee00', '#ff4444', '#ffee00', '.'],\n  ['.', '#ffee00', '#ffee00', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '.', '.', '.', '.'],\n  ['.', '#ffee00', '#ffee00', '#ffee00', '.'],\n  ['#ffee00', '#ff2222', '#ff2222', '#ffee00', '.'],\n];\n\n\n/* ============================================================\n   4. DRAWING HELPERS\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst drawSprite = (sprite, x, y, scale) => {\n  const s = scale || SCALE;\n  const rows = sprite.length;\n  const cols = sprite[0].length;\n\n  for (let row = 0; row < rows; row++) {\n    for (let col = 0; col < cols; col++) {\n      const colour = sprite[row][col];\n\n      if (!colour || colour === '.') continue;\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = colour;\n      ctx.fillRect(\n        Math.round(x + col * s),\n        Math.round(y + row * s),\n        s,\n        s\n      );\n    }\n  }\n};\n\nconst guardCanvasX = (pathPos) => {\n  return LEFT_BOUND + (pathPos / PATROL_WIDTH) * PATROL_PX;\n};\n\nconst PLAYER_CANVAS_X = guardCanvasX(PLAYER_PATH_POS);\n\nconst drawGuardTopDown = (x, y, facingRight) => {\n  const s = SCALE;\n\n  for (let row = 0; row < 8; row++) {\n    for (let col = 0; col < 10; col++) {\n      const colour = GUARD_SPRITE_BASE[row][col];\n\n      if (!colour || colour === '.') continue;\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = colour;\n      ctx.fillRect(\n        Math.round(x + col * s),\n        Math.round(y + row * s),\n        s,\n        s\n      );\n    }\n  }\n\n  const indicatorColor = '#ffee44';\n  ctx.fillStyle = indicatorColor;\n\n  if (facingRight) {\n    ctx.fillRect(Math.round(x + 8 * s), Math.round(y + 2 * s), s, s);\n    ctx.fillRect(Math.round(x + 9 * s), Math.round(y + 3 * s), s, s);\n    ctx.fillRect(Math.round(x + 8 * s), Math.round(y + 4 * s), s, s);\n  } else {\n    ctx.fillRect(Math.round(x - 1 * s), Math.round(y + 2 * s), s, s);\n    ctx.fillRect(Math.round(x - 2 * s), Math.round(y + 3 * s), s, s);\n    ctx.fillRect(Math.round(x - 1 * s), Math.round(y + 4 * s), s, s);\n  }\n};\n\nconst drawWallBlock = (x, y, w, h) => {\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#2a2528';\n  ctx.fillRect(x, y, w, h);\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#352e32';\n  ctx.fillRect(x, y, w, 2);\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#302a2e';\n  ctx.fillRect(x, y, 2, h);\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#1a1820';\n  ctx.fillRect(x, y + h - 2, w, 2);\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#1e1c20';\n\n  for (let ly = y + 24; ly < y + h; ly += 24) {\n    ctx.fillRect(x + 2, ly, w - 4, 1);\n  }\n\n  for (let lx = x + 48; lx < x + w; lx += 48) {\n    ctx.fillRect(lx, y + 2, 1, h - 4);\n  }\n};\n\nconst drawBackground = () => {\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#5a7088';\n  ctx.fillRect(0, 0, CANVAS_W, HUD_Y);\n\n  for (let tr = 0; tr < TILE_ROWS; tr++) {\n    for (let tc = 0; tc < TILE_COLS; tc++) {\n      const tx = tc * TILE_SIZE + (tc > 0 ? GRID_LINE_W * tc : 0);\n      const ty = tr * TILE_SIZE + (tr > 0 ? GRID_LINE_W * tr : 0);\n\n      if (ty >= HUD_Y) continue;\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = TILE_COLORS[tr][tc];\n      ctx.fillRect(tx, ty, TILE_SIZE, TILE_SIZE);\n    }\n  }\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#000000';\n  ctx.fillRect(0, HUD_Y, CANVAS_W, HUD_HEIGHT);\n\n  drawWallBlock(120, 140, 560, 48);\n  drawWallBlock(340, 188, 96, 48);\n\n  drawWallBlock(60, 200, 48, 96);\n  drawWallBlock(60, 296, 144, 48);\n};\n\nconst drawSightBeam = (guardCenterX, inSight) => {\n  const tipY = PATROL_Y_GUARD;\n  const farY = PATROL_Y_PLAYER;\n  const halfW = 36;\n\n  const fillAlpha = inSight ? 0.45 : 0.18;\n  const strokeAlpha = inSight ? 0.80 : 0.35;\n  const glowAlpha = inSight ? 0.50 : 0.22;\n  const glowRadius = inSight ? 18 : 12;\n\n  ctx.save();\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 220, 50, ${fillAlpha})`;\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.moveTo(guardCenterX, tipY);\n  ctx.lineTo(guardCenterX - halfW, farY);\n  ctx.lineTo(guardCenterX + halfW, farY);\n  ctx.closePath();\n  ctx.fill();\n\n  ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 220, 50, ${strokeAlpha})`;\n  ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.moveTo(guardCenterX, tipY);\n  ctx.lineTo(guardCenterX - halfW, farY);\n  ctx.lineTo(guardCenterX + halfW, farY);\n  ctx.closePath();\n  ctx.stroke();\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 220, 50, ${glowAlpha})`;\n  ctx.beginPath();\n  ctx.arc(guardCenterX, tipY, glowRadius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n  ctx.fill();\n\n  ctx.restore();\n};\n\nconst drawHUD = (status, stepNum) => {\n  ctx.font = '18px monospace';\n  ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';\n\n  const midY = HUD_Y + HUD_HEIGHT / 2;\n\n  if (status === 'patrol') {\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#44ff88';\n    ctx.fillText('STATUS: PATROLLING', 14, midY);\n  } else {\n    ctx.fillStyle = '#ff4444';\n    ctx.fillText('STATUS: !! ALERT !!', 14, midY);\n  }\n\n  ctx.fillStyle = '#aaaacc';\n  ctx.textAlign = 'right';\n  ctx.fillText('STEP: ' + stepNum, CANVAS_W - 14, midY);\n  ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n};\n/* ============================================================\n   5. GAME STATE & EVENT QUEUE\n   ============================================================ */\n\nlet gameEvents = [];\nlet iterationCount = 0;\nlet safetyCapHit = false;\n\nlet studentCodeSource = '';\n\n\n/* ============================================================\n   6. PATROL ENGINE\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst computeGuardPathPos = (stepNum) => {\n  const phase = stepNum % (PATROL_WIDTH * 2);\n  return phase < PATROL_WIDTH ? phase : (PATROL_WIDTH * 2) - phase;\n};\n\nconst patrolStep = (stepArg) => {\n  iterationCount++;\n\n  if (iterationCount > 200) {\n    safetyCapHit = true;\n    window.playerDetected = true;\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const guardPathPos = computeGuardPathPos(stepArg);\n  const inSight = Math.abs(guardPathPos - PLAYER_PATH_POS) <= 1;\n\n  gameEvents.push({\n    type: 'patrol',\n    step: stepArg,\n    guardPathPos: guardPathPos,\n    inSight: inSight\n  });\n};\n\nconst detectPlayer = () => {\n  const currentStep = window.step || 0;\n  const guardPathPos = computeGuardPathPos(currentStep);\n\n  return Math.abs(guardPathPos - PLAYER_PATH_POS) <= 1;\n};\n\nconst alertMode = (finalStep) => {\n  gameEvents.push({\n    type: 'result',\n    step: finalStep,\n    safetyCapHit: safetyCapHit,\n    playerDetected: window.playerDetected\n  });\n\n  animateEvents();\n};\n\n\n// Make these available to the fetched/evaled student code.\nwindow.patrolStep = patrolStep;\nwindow.detectPlayer = detectPlayer;\nwindow.alertMode = alertMode;\n\n\n/* ============================================================\n   7. ANIMATION PLAYBACK\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst startCanvasLoop = () => {\n  const guardPathPos = 0;\n  const facingRight = true;\n\n  drawScene(guardPathPos, facingRight, false, false, 'patrol', 0);\n};\n\nconst animateEvents = () => {\n  let eventIndex = 0;\n  let lastGuardPx = guardCanvasX(0);\n  let lastFacing = true;\n\n  startCanvasLoop();\n\n  const interval = setInterval(() => {\n    if (eventIndex >= gameEvents.length) {\n      clearInterval(interval);\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const event = gameEvents[eventIndex];\n    eventIndex++;\n\n    if (event.type === 'patrol') {\n      const gx = guardCanvasX(event.guardPathPos);\n\n      const facingRight = gx >= lastGuardPx;\n      lastFacing = facingRight;\n\n      const showAlert = event.inSight && window.playerDetected && !safetyCapHit;\n\n      drawScene(\n        event.guardPathPos,\n        facingRight,\n        event.inSight,\n        showAlert,\n        'patrol',\n        event.step\n      );\n\n      lastGuardPx = gx;\n\n    } else if (event.type === 'result') {\n      drawScene(\n        computeGuardPathPos(event.step),\n        lastFacing,\n        false,\n        event.playerDetected && !safetyCapHit,\n        'alert',\n        event.step\n      );\n\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        showResultOverlay(event);\n      }, 400);\n    }\n  }, 120);\n};\n\nconst drawScene = (guardPathPos, facingRight, inSight, showAlert, hudStatus, stepNum) => {\n  const guardX = guardCanvasX(guardPathPos);\n\n  const spriteW = GUARD_SPRITE_W * SCALE;\n  const spriteH = GUARD_SPRITE_H * SCALE;\n\n  const guardDrawX = guardX - spriteW / 2;\n  const guardDrawY = PATROL_Y_GUARD - spriteH / 2;\n  const playerDrawX = PLAYER_CANVAS_X - spriteW / 2;\n  const playerDrawY = PATROL_Y_PLAYER - spriteH / 2;\n\n  const guardCenterX = guardDrawX + spriteW / 2;\n\n  drawBackground();\n\n  drawSightBeam(guardCenterX, inSight);\n\n  drawSprite(PLAYER_SPRITE, playerDrawX, playerDrawY, SCALE);\n\n  drawGuardTopDown(guardDrawX, guardDrawY, facingRight);\n\n  if (showAlert) {\n    const alertW = ALERT_SPRITE[0].length * SCALE;\n    const alertH = ALERT_SPRITE.length * SCALE;\n\n    drawSprite(\n      ALERT_SPRITE,\n      guardCenterX - alertW / 2,\n      guardDrawY - alertH - 6,\n      SCALE\n    );\n  }\n\n  drawHUD(hudStatus, stepNum);\n};\n/* ============================================================\n   8. RESULT OVERLAY\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst showResultOverlay = (event) => {\n  const overlay = document.getElementById('result-overlay');\n\n  overlay.classList.remove('hidden', 'bug-present', 'bug-fixed', 'visible');\n  overlay.innerHTML = '';\n\n  if (event.safetyCapHit) {\n    overlay.classList.add('bug-present');\n\n    const title = document.createElement('div');\n    title.className = 'result-title';\n    title.textContent = 'GUARD NEVER ALERTED';\n\n    const sub = document.createElement('div');\n    sub.className = 'result-sub';\n    sub.textContent = 'The patrol ran for 200 steps.';\n\n    const btn = document.createElement('button');\n    btn.className = 'play-again-btn';\n    btn.textContent = 'PLAY AGAIN';\n    btn.addEventListener('click', rerunGame);\n\n    overlay.appendChild(title);\n    overlay.appendChild(sub);\n    overlay.appendChild(btn);\n\n  } else {\n    overlay.classList.add('bug-fixed');\n\n    const title = document.createElement('div');\n    title.className = 'result-title';\n    title.textContent = 'PLAYER DETECTED!';\n\n    const sub = document.createElement('div');\n    sub.className = 'result-sub';\n    sub.textContent = 'Guard spotted you on step ' + event.step + '.';\n\n    const btn = document.createElement('button');\n    btn.className = 'play-again-btn';\n    btn.textContent = 'PLAY AGAIN';\n    btn.addEventListener('click', rerunGame);\n\n    overlay.appendChild(title);\n    overlay.appendChild(sub);\n    overlay.appendChild(btn);\n  }\n\n  overlay.classList.add('visible');\n};\n\n\n/* ============================================================\n   9. BOOTSTRAP — fetch script.js, eval, support Play Again\n   ============================================================ */\n\nconst resetGameState = () => {\n  gameEvents = [];\n  iterationCount = 0;\n  safetyCapHit = false;\n\n  window.playerDetected = false;\n  window.step = 0;\n};\n\nconst runStudentCode = (source) => {\n  resetGameState();\n\n  const globalised = source\n    .replace(/\\blet\\s+/g, '')\n    .replace(/\\bconst\\s+/g, '');\n\n  console.log('[Castle Patrol] Running student code...');\n\n  try {\n    (0, eval)(globalised);\n  } catch (err) {\n    console.error('[Castle Patrol] Error in student code:', err);\n  }\n};\n\nconst rerunGame = () => {\n  const overlay = document.getElementById('result-overlay');\n  overlay.classList.remove('visible');\n  overlay.classList.add('hidden');\n\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    runStudentCode(studentCodeSource);\n  }, 300);\n};\n\nwindow.rerunGame = rerunGame;\n\nwindow.addEventListener('load', () => {\n  drawBackground();\n  drawHUD('patrol', 0);\n\n  fetch('script.js')\n    .then((response) => {\n      if (!response.ok) {\n        throw new Error('Could not load script.js — status ' + response.status);\n      }\n\n      return response.text();\n    })\n    .then((source) => {\n      studentCodeSource = source;\n      runStudentCode(source);\n    })\n    .catch((err) => {\n      console.error('[Castle Patrol] Failed to load script.js:', err);\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0,0,0,0.7)';\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, CANVAS_W, CANVAS_H);\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#ff4444';\n      ctx.font = '18px monospace';\n      ctx.textAlign = 'center';\n      ctx.fillText('ERROR: script.js not found', CANVAS_W / 2, CANVAS_H / 2 - 10);\n\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#888888';\n      ctx.font = '18px monospace';\n      ctx.fillText('Open this via a local server', CANVAS_W / 2, CANVAS_H / 2 + 16);\n\n      ctx.textAlign = 'left';\n    });\n});",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false,
          "type": "support"
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "script.js",
          "contents": "// The guard patrols while the player hasn't been detected.\nlet playerDetected = false;\nlet step = 0;\n\nwhile (playerDetected === false) {\n    step++;\n    patrolStep(step);\n  // What information should the loop use to decide \n  // when the player has been detected?\n\n}\n\nalertMode(step);\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "4"
      ]
    },
